.git
src_rust/rust_audio_core/target
src_rust/rust_viz_core/target
src_rust/rust_launcher/target
# Stray Rust build artifacts from working on the flatpak/portal-engine-wire
# branch (where src/ IS the Rust workspace). On main, src/ is the Python
# tree and these subdirs are untracked / not part of the source. Without
# this exclusion the docker build context balloons to ~36 GB and the
# rootless buildkit context-builder fails before COPY can even run.
src/target
src/rust_audio_core
src/rust_viz_core
src/rust_launcher
src/rust_tidal_core
src/Cargo.lock
build_tmp
build-flatpak
.flatpak-builder
.codex
dist
build_rpmbuild_*
build_archpkg
__pycache__
*.pyc
.claude
